  "prefLabel": "Pda 301.16 Pilotage area",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Pda 301.16 “Pilotage area” means an area landward of the line of demarcation, including, but not limited to, Portsmouth Harbor and the Piscataqua River up to and including Dover Point, New Hampshire.\n\nSource. #7870, eff 4-12-03; ss by #9891-A, eff 4-1-11; ss by #12760, eff 4-19-19",
